  m_text: 'Thank you so much for playing.


    This was my submission and attempt
    at a game for the Brackeys Game Jam 2026.2.


    I drew heavy inspiration from
    Cat-Mario and Trees hate you, which might have been obvious in the game.


    Looking
    forward to playing others'' games as well, these are always a mix of emotions
    and this year was a ride as well, a good one!


    Have a great day, Stranger
    <3 :)'
